{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 3, "text": "去，打得接的人狼狈不堪，", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 330, "w": 494, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "去，打得接的人狼狈不堪，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 330, "w": 494, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 4, "text": "但接亲的人们不能有丝毫", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 394, "w": 494, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "但接亲的人们不能有丝毫", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 394, "w": 494, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 5, "text": "还击的表示。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1173, "y": 455, "w": 235, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "还击的表示。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1173, "y": 455, "w": 235, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 6, "text": "当晚，女方家大摆筵席", "bbox_px": {"x": 1258, "y": 523, "w": 406, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "当晚，女方家大摆筵席", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1258, "y": 523, "w": 406, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 7, "text": "招待男方家来客，在堂屋内", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 587, "w": 490, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "招待男方家来客，在堂屋内", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 587, "w": 490, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 8, "text": "设置专席招待新郎、陪郎，并", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 652, "w": 494, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "设置专席招待新郎、陪郎，并", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 652, "w": 494, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 9, "text": "请房族同辈亲友作陪。席", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 716, "w": 494, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请房族同辈亲友作陪。席", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 716, "w": 494, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 10, "text": "间，招待客人的姑娘们对新", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 781, "w": 494, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "间，招待客人的姑娘们对新", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 781, "w": 494, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 11, "text": "郎、陪郎百般刁难，以此取", "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 849, "w": 490, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "郎、陪郎百般刁难，以此取", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 849, "w": 490, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 12, "text": "乐。筵毕，进行对歌。寨子", "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 909, "w": 490, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乐。筵毕，进行对歌。寨子", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 909, "w": 490, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 13, "text": "接亲", "bbox_px": {"x": 575, "y": 990, "w": 109, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "接亲", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 575, "y": 990, "w": 109, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 14, "text": "里的歌手们云聚而来，轮番", "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 982, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "里的歌手们云聚而来，轮番", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 982, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 15, "text": "与男方来的客人对唱。接亲", "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 1046, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与男方来的客人对唱。接亲", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1178, "y": 1046, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 16, "text": "队伍里一般都有些唱歌能手，对歌往往分不出胜负。如男方对歌输了，女方村寨的歌手", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "队伍里一般都有些唱歌能手，对歌往往分不出胜负。如男方对歌输了，女方村寨的歌手", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 17, "text": "往往要把新郎、陪郎及客人们弄得哭笑不得才罢休。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1175, "w": 901, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "往往要把新郎、陪郎及客人们弄得哭笑不得才罢休。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1175, "w": 901, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 18, "text": "第二天清早发亲时，女方家要主持祭供仪式，新郎和新娘跪拜天地和女方家祖先、父", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1239, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第二天清早发亲时，女方家要主持祭供仪式，新郎和新娘跪拜天地和女方家祖先、父", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1239, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 19, "text": "母以及堂亲伯叔。独山、平塘和威宁一带，新娘有哥哥，要由哥哥背出家门。兴义的顶效", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1304, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "母以及堂亲伯叔。独山、平塘和威宁一带，新娘有哥哥，要由哥哥背出家门。兴义的顶效", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1304, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 20, "text": "和威宁、平塘的一些地方，姑娘兴哭嫁（传说哭才吉利）。个别地区（如威宁一些地方），新", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1368, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "和威宁、平塘的一些地方，姑娘兴哭嫁（传说哭才吉利）。个别地区（如威宁一些地方），新", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1368, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 21, "text": "娘要由接亲人轮流背到男家。紫云一带，在新娘过桥时，要由自家哥哥背过桥。罗甸、独", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1432, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "娘要由接亲人轮流背到男家。紫云一带，在新娘过桥时，要由自家哥哥背过桥。罗甸、独", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1432, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 22, "text": "山、安龙等县用花轿迎接新娘。盘县是新娘坐轿，送亲人骑马。大多数地区新娘是步行", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1497, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "山、安龙等县用花轿迎接新娘。盘县是新娘坐轿，送亲人骑马。大多数地区新娘是步行", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1497, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 23, "text": "到男家。无论何种形式，新娘前往男家的途中，如遇别的接亲队伍必须绕道而走。不能", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1561, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "到男家。无论何种形式，新娘前往男家的途中，如遇别的接亲队伍必须绕道而走。不能", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1561, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 24, "text": "走他人同日接亲已经走过的路，否则不吉利。在有的地方，新娘到达男家村寨时，要先", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1629, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "走他人同日接亲已经走过的路，否则不吉利。在有的地方，新娘到达男家村寨时，要先", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1629, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 25, "text": "借住邻舍，次日的“吉时”再进男家。罗甸一带，新娘进家时，新郎的父母、兄嫂要先走出", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "借住邻舍，次日的“吉时”再进男家。罗甸一带，新娘进家时，新郎的父母、兄嫂要先走出", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 26, "text": "屋外，让新娘进家，以示今后和睦。另有一些地区则由婆婆走出屋外，表示让新儿媳来当", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1758, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "屋外，让新娘进家，以示今后和睦。另有一些地区则由婆婆走出屋外，表示让新儿媳来当", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1758, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 27, "text": "家。多数地区新郎和新娘都要经过拜礼堂和拜见公婆，然后新娘才能进入洞房。威宁一", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1823, "w": 1560, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家。多数地区新郎和新娘都要经过拜礼堂和拜见公婆，然后新娘才能进入洞房。威宁一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1823, "w": 1560, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 28, "text": "带新娘进洞房时，要请巫师“退车马”或“刷身上”，以示除邪。新娘入洞房后，房中只准伴", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1883, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "带新娘进洞房时，要请巫师“退车马”或“刷身上”，以示除邪。新娘入洞房后，房中只准伴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1883, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 29, "text": "娘、男方的妹妹或同辈的女青年进出，男方请的女歌手也在新房内作伴、对歌。新郎及寨", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1947, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "娘、男方的妹妹或同辈的女青年进出，男方请的女歌手也在新房内作伴、对歌。新郎及寨", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1947, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 30, "text": "上的男性都不能进入新房，不兴闹新房。部分地区新郎与新娘不兴拜堂，新郎还要回避。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2012, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "上的男性都不能进入新房，不兴闹新房。部分地区新郎与新娘不兴拜堂，新郎还要回避。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 2012, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 31, "text": "如长顺县古羊一带，新郎不亲自去接亲，不请八仙，只请八个青年男子去接。女家也请八", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2076, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "如长顺县古羊一带，新郎不亲自去接亲，不请八仙，只请八个青年男子去接。女家也请八", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2076, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 32, "text": "个姑娘送亲。镇宁扁担山一带，在整个结婚仪式中，完全看不出谁是新郎。新郎与新娘", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2148, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个姑娘送亲。镇宁扁担山一带，在整个结婚仪式中，完全看不出谁是新郎。新郎与新娘", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2148, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 33, "text": "不实行夫妇交拜礼，不说话，不接触，新郎在服装上也没有特别的标志，也没有人向他道", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2209, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不实行夫妇交拜礼，不说话，不接触，新郎在服装上也没有特别的标志，也没有人向他道", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2209, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 34, "text": "贺，只偶尔有些年轻人向他开开玩笑，他和一般人同样干活，同样喝酒。特别是早婚的，", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2277, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "贺，只偶尔有些年轻人向他开开玩笑，他和一般人同样干活，同样喝酒。特别是早婚的，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2277, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 242, "line_no": 35, "text": "有的新郎才八九岁，新娘才十一二岁，新郎根本不懂得结婚对他本人的意义，结婚之日照", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2342, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有的新郎才八九岁，新娘才十一二岁，新郎根本不懂得结婚对他本人的意义，结婚之日照", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2342, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
